  "description": "Unleash chaos. Drop memes. Prank your friends.\n\nVoicemod is your all-in-one app for funny sounds, sound pads, and building custom soundboards your squad never knew they needed.\n\nWhether you’re sending meme sounds, making your own soundboard, or browsing a massive library of instant sound buttons, this app delivers pure noise (the good kind).\n\nYou can even record voice messages using hilarious voice changers—turn into a robot, demon, or chipmunk—and share them instantly on comm apps or social networks or wherever your chaos needs to go. It's the perfect way to prank, react, or just confuse your friends with your new identity.\n\nWhat You’ll Get\n\n500,000+ Meme Sounds\nDiscover one of the biggest meme sound libraries out there. From viral hits to weird niche clips, our soundboard library has it all. New funny sounds are added daily by the community.\n\nBuild Custom Soundboards\nMake unlimited soundboards with your favorite memes and audio clips. Sort them how you want—or don’t. That’s your chaos.\n\nRecord & Share Voice-Changer Messages\nUse fun voice effects to record voice messages—then share them instantly on comm apps or wherever your chaos lives. Become a robot, demon, or squirrel and drop voice bombs in your group chats.\n\nShare with Friends\nSend sounds in group chats, DMs, or wherever you’re causing trouble. Pro move: link to a Bluetooth speaker and go full IRL prank mode.\n\nReal-Time Voice Use? That’s Desktop Only.\nThis app doesn’t work live in voice chat apps or games.\n\nWant that? Download the Voicemod Desktop App for Windows or Mac.\n\nWhether you’re into meme soundboards, funny audio clips, memes, anime sounds, or just pressing buttons that go “bonk,” this app is for you.",
